  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sverige bidrar med st&#xf6;d till att MOPAN (Multilateral Organisations Performance Assessment Network) som genomf&#xf6;r bed&#xf6;mningar av de multilateral organisationernas st&#xf6;d i syfte st&#xe4;rka det multilaterala utvecklingssamarbetet</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sweden supports MOPAN (Multilateral Organisations Performance Assessment Network) carrying out assessments of multilateral organisations with the purpose of strenghening multilateral cooperation.</narrative>
